---
import Base from "@/layouts/Base.astro";
import AssetImage from "@/components/AssetImage.astro";
import SectionHeading from "@/components/SectionHeading.astro";
import { destinationOrganizations } from "@/data/audiences";
---

<Base title="Careers | Global Enterprise" description="Join Global Enterprise and help design operating models, intelligence systems, and institutional capabilities that hold under pressure." image="/media/original/careers-apprentice.avif" keywords={["Global Enterprise careers", "future-facing consulting careers", "AI research careers", "strategy careers", "enterprise transformation careers"]}>
  <section class="bg-cobalt py-20 text-white md:py-28"><div class="container-site grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_.72fr] lg:items-end"><div><p class="eyebrow text-lime">Careers</p><h1 class="section-title mt-7 max-w-5xl">Bring range, rigor, and a point of view.</h1><p class="mt-8 max-w-2xl text-xl leading-relaxed text-white/75">We are building a serious, interdisciplinary team for work that sits between frontier intelligence, institutional strategy, technology, and the reality of making change hold.</p></div><div><div class="border-t border-white/20 pt-6"><p class="max-w-sm text-lg leading-relaxed text-white/70">One standard: make the work more useful than you found it.</p></div><figure class="mt-8 overflow-hidden border border-white/20 bg-ink"><AssetImage src="/media/original/careers-apprentice.avif" width={1536} height={1024} loading="eager" decoding="async" alt="Senior practitioners reviewing an enterprise operating blueprint at a strategy table" class="aspect-[16/9] w-full object-cover opacity-90" /><figcaption class="border-t border-white/15 px-4 py-3 text-xs leading-relaxed text-white/60">Capability grows when standards transfer into durable operating systems.</figcaption></figure></div></div></section>
  <section class="section-pad bg-white"><div class="container-site grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[.8fr_1.2fr] lg:gap-24"><SectionHeading eyebrow="Why here" title="High standards. Low theater." /><div class="space-y-6 text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted"><p>You will work with operators and experts who treat complexity as a governance problem, not a project heroics problem. We make room for clear writing, disciplined disagreement, and delivery that holds after handoff.</p><p>Our engagements shape AI-native operations, data institutions, frontier research, resilient systems, and workforce architecture at institutional scale.</p><p>We recruit people who can sustain this depth over multi-year mandates and keep outcomes useful after the first phase.</p><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4 pt-2"><a class="btn-dark" href={destinationOrganizations.taoStaff.href} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Explore career pathways at Tao Staff <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="btn-ghost" href={destinationOrganizations.igniteCuriosity.href} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Explore early-career pathways <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div></div></section>
  <section class="section-pad bg-paper"><div class="container-site"><SectionHeading eyebrow="How we work together" title="The team is part of the product." /><div class="mt-16 grid gap-px border border-line bg-line md:grid-cols-3"><div class="bg-paper p-8 md:p-10"><p class="eyebrow text-cobalt">Outcome</p><h2 class="mt-14 font-display text-3xl font-bold tracking-[-0.06em]">Own the outcome</h2><p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-muted">Be clear about what better looks like, then stay close to the people who need to feel it.</p></div><div class="bg-paper p-8 md:p-10"><p class="eyebrow text-cobalt">Legibility</p><h2 class="mt-14 font-display text-3xl font-bold tracking-[-0.06em]">Make it legible</h2><p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-muted">Good work should help the next person see what matters and what to do next.</p></div><div class="bg-paper p-8 md:p-10"><p class="eyebrow text-cobalt">Curiosity</p><h2 class="mt-14 font-display text-3xl font-bold tracking-[-0.06em]">Stay curious</h2><p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-muted">The world changes. We keep learning, testing, and updating our point of view.</p></div></div></div></section>
  <section class="section-pad bg-paper"><div class="container-site grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[.75fr_1.25fr] lg:gap-24"><SectionHeading eyebrow="The work you might do" title="The work is varied. The standard is not." /><div class="grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2"><div class="border-t border-line pt-5"><h2 class="font-display text-xl font-medium">Deliver the program</h2><p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-muted">Turn a complex mandate into sequencing, decision forums, dependency visibility, and a delivery rhythm a team can run.</p></div><div class="border-t border-line pt-5"><h2 class="font-display text-xl font-medium">Plan the workforce</h2><p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-muted">Connect role design, capacity assumptions, skill gaps, and learning loops to the operating model instead of a course catalog.</p></div><div class="border-t border-line pt-5"><h2 class="font-display text-xl font-medium">Build for global infrastructure</h2><p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-muted">Make cloud, data, identity, resilience, and partner boundaries visible across regions and time zones.</p></div><div class="border-t border-line pt-5"><h2 class="font-display text-xl font-medium">Prepare data, AI, and quantum readiness</h2><p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-muted">Translate data quality, evaluation, compute economics, and plausible frontier use cases into evidence for the next investment decision.</p></div></div></div></section>
  <section class="section-pad bg-white"><div class="container-site grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[.75fr_1.25fr] lg:gap-24"><SectionHeading eyebrow="Openings and process" title="A clear path for future colleagues." /><div class="space-y-6 text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted"><div class="border-l-2 border-cobalt pl-5"><p class="eyebrow text-cobalt">Current status</p><p class="mt-3">Global Enterprise does not list public roles on this site. Tao Staff is the organization-wide career destination; this page provides mandate context and working standards, not an employment guarantee.</p></div><p><strong class="text-ink">Experienced candidates:</strong> explore career pathways through Tao Staff, including the roles and training routes that fit your background.</p><p><strong class="text-ink">Early-career candidates:</strong> start with Ignite Curiosity for internships, apprenticeships, fellowships, and learning pathways.</p><p><strong class="text-ink">Access:</strong> request an accommodation or alternative format through the destination's published contact path. We evaluate capability and judgment, not style.</p><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4"><a class="btn-dark" href={destinationOrganizations.taoStaff.href} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Explore Tao Staff <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="btn-ghost" href={destinationOrganizations.igniteCuriosity.href} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Explore Ignite Curiosity <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div></div></section>
</Base>
